  "nodes": {
    "asleep": {
      "text": "(Fast asleep. Best not to wake them.)",
      "speaker": "narrator"
    },
    "main": {
      "text": "Welcome to Hobb and Daughters. The daughters are in Veylport, being expensive.",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Let's trade.",
          "go": "end",
          "tag": "trade",
          "actions": [
            {
              "shop": "general_store",
              "type": "open_shop"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I need leather for a pump valve.",
          "go": "leather",
          "tag": "quest",
          "when": {
            "quest_stage": {
              "quest": "m02",
              "stage": "parts"
            },
            "not": {
              "has_item": {
                "item": "hollowatlas:valve_leather"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "Who decides who gets the empty stall?",
          "go": "stall_q",
          "tag": "ask"
        },
        {
          "text": "Goodbye.",
          "go": "end",
          "tag": "leave"
        }
      ]
    },
    "leather": {
      "text": "Valve leather? Tobin's pump, I'd wager. I've a cut of oiled hide that'll do. Six coins.",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Here's six.",
          "go": "end",
          "tag": "trade",
          "actions": [
            {
              "amount": -6,
              "type": "coins"
            },
            {
              "item": "hollowatlas:valve_leather",
              "type": "give_item"
            }
          ],
          "enabled_when": {
            "coins_min": 6
          },
          "disabled_hint": "You need 6 coins."
        },
        {
          "text": "Maybe later.",
          "go": "end",
          "tag": "leave"
        }
      ]
    },
    "stall_q": {
      "text": "I keep the market roll. The Hall says the stall goes to whoever the roll says. The roll says whatever I write. So, me.",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Goodbye.",
          "go": "end",
          "tag": "leave"
        }
      ]
    },
    "stall": {
      "text": "So. You've been in the middle of the ribbon business. Who should have the empty stall, in your view? I'll listen. I may even agree.",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Sabine. Her cloth deserves the front of the square.",
          "go": "stall_s",
          "tag": "persuade"
        },
        {
          "text": "Maren. Bread feeds the whole village.",
          "go": "stall_m",
          "tag": "persuade"
        },
        {
          "text": "Both. Split the day: bread in the morning, cloth after.",
          "go": "stall_b",
          "tag": "persuade"
        }
      ]
    },
    "stall_s": {
      "text": "Sabine, then. Maren will sulk for a week, but she'll live. I'll write it on the roll.",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Goodbye.",
          "go": "end",
          "tag": "leave"
        }
      ],
      "actions": [
        {
          "npc": "sabine",
          "variant": "stall_sabine",
          "type": "set_variant"
        },
        {
          "flag": "hollowatlas:stall_b_sabine",
          "type": "world_flag"
        },
        {
          "flag": "hollowatlas:stall_b_resolved",
          "type": "world_flag"
        },
        {
          "quest": "sq01",
          "key": "stall",
          "value": "sabine",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "npc": "sabine",
          "delta": 8,
          "type": "relationship"
        },
        {
          "npc": "maren",
          "delta": -4,
          "type": "relationship"
        },
        {
          "event": "talk",
          "target": "stall_decided",
          "type": "quest_event"
        }
      ]
    },
    "stall_m": {
      "text": "Maren. Sabine will call me a philistine, which is the nicest thing she's called me. I'll write it on the roll.",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Goodbye.",
          "go": "end",
          "tag": "leave"
        }
      ],
      "actions": [
        {
          "npc": "maren",
          "variant": "stall_maren",
          "type": "set_variant"
        },
        {
          "flag": "hollowatlas:stall_b_maren",
          "type": "world_flag"
        },
        {
          "flag": "hollowatlas:stall_b_resolved",
          "type": "world_flag"
        },
        {
          "quest": "sq01",
          "key": "stall",
          "value": "maren",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "npc": "maren",
          "delta": 8,
          "type": "relationship"
        },
        {
          "npc": "sabine",
          "delta": -4,
          "type": "relationship"
        },
        {
          "event": "talk",
          "target": "stall_decided",
          "type": "quest_event"
        }
      ]
    },
    "stall_b": {
      "text": "Share it? They'll hate that. ...Which probably means it's fair. Bread until one, cloth after. I'll write it on the roll.",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Goodbye.",
          "go": "end",
          "tag": "leave"
        }
      ],
